4. volatile
    ✅ One-writer, many-reader scenarios
    “volatile guarantees visibility, not atomicity.” --> i++ not correct
    When Thread A writes to a volatile variable:
    Thread B is guaranteed to see the updated value immediately.
    Without volatile:
        Thread B may read a stale cached value
        The update may never be observed

